  <dashboards>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='DOCUMENTATION'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97298' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98614' x='693' y='1351'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20' underline='true'>BUSINESS FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENT DOCUMENT (FRD)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='15'>1. PROJECT CONTEXT &amp; CONSTRAINTS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Business Problem</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Executives lack visibility into margin leakage, sub-category performance, and product return rates.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>As-Is State</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Fragmented monthly Excel exports that delay decision-making and lack interactive drill-down capabilities.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Dependencies</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: timely reverse-logistics logging for returns</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='15'>2. DASHBOARD LAYOUT &amp; DESIGN SYSTEM</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Grid Framework</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Fixed 3-row structured hierarchy optimizing executive visual scanning from top to bottom.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Color Palette</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Light-gray canvas background (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='monospace' fontsize='11'>#F5F5F5</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>) with bold accent coloring to isolate adjacent data blocks.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Visual Indicators</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Functional UI control shortcuts positioned in the top-right header for </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>PPT</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>PDF</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>, and </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Clear View</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Performance SLA</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: All interactive filter changes and query rendering must compile completely in under 2 seconds.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='15'>3. GLOBAL FILTERS &amp; CONTROLS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Metric Selector</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Radio-button container (</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='monospace' fontsize='11'>Sales</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>, </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='monospace' fontsize='11'>Profit</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>, </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='monospace' fontsize='11'>#Orders</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>) wrapped with a functional visual funnel icon.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Year Filter</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Dropdown menu allowing targeted chronological filtering of historical data.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Region Filter</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Multi-select dropdown initialized to </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='monospace' fontsize='11'>(All)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> by default to scope data geographically.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='15'>4. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY (KPI CARDS)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>TOTAL Sales</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Centered numeric display formatted in Indian Rupee notation showing total aggregated volume</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>PROFIT MARGIN</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Centered percentage calculated as </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='monospace' fontsize='11'>(Sum of Profit / Sum of Sales) * 100</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>, accurate to two decimals.</run>
