              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>RETURN RATE</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Centered percentage calculated as </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='monospace' fontsize='11'>(Count of Returned Orders / Count of Total Orders) * 100</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='15'>5. REVENUE SEGMENTATION &amp; ANALYTICAL CHARTS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Category By Sales</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Horizontal bar chart mapping parent categories with custom colors (Technology: Green, Furniture: Red, Office Supplies: Pink).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Sub-Category By Sales</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Sorted descending horizontal bar chart displaying explicit data value labels next to individual product lines.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Sales By States</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Filled geographic map visualization featuring dynamic overlay labels for </run>
