              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>) with total volume inside the center.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Month Wise Sales</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>: Historical line graph tracked across continuous months, split by yearly grid lines, highlighting baseline and peak data points.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
