    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='INSIGHTS'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97298' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98662' x='669' y='1351'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20' underline='true'>INSIGHTS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>1. High-Level Performance &amp; Efficiency</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>While Superstore, USA generated a massive </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>₹2.30M in Total Sales</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>, it operates on a lean </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>12.47% Profit Margin</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Conduct a deep-dive cost analysis into supply chain logistics or vendor pricing to optimize the margin closer.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>2. Technology Drives Revenue, Furniture Strains Margins</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Technology</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> is the highest-grossing category (</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>₹836,154</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>), led by </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Phones</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> and </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Chairs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> in sub-categories. Conversely, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Office Supplies</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> lag in sales volume</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> Shift marketing spend to promote high-margin Technology accessories. Bundle low-performing Office Supplies (like Fasteners and Envelopes) to increase their average order value.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>3. Consumer Segment Dominance</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> The </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Consumer Segment</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> represents over half of your business at </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>50.56%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>, followed by Corporate (30.74%) and Home Office (18.70%).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Launch a loyalty program specifically targeted at the Consumer segment to increase repeat purchases. Simultaneously, create a B2B sales outreach strategy to expand the higher-volume Corporate segment.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>4. The Return Rate Risk</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> The overall </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Return Rate stands at 5.91%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>A return rate near 6% for a retail superstore is a significant leak in net profit, introducing heavy reverse-logistics costs.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Cross-reference this return rate with the &quot;Sales by States&quot; map. Identify if specific states  or specific product sub-categories have disproportionately high return rates due to shipping damages or poor product descriptions.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='15'>5.Cyclical Q4 Sales Spikes</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Month Wise Sales</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> line chart reveals a distinct, repeating seasonal pattern: sharp dips early in the year followed by explosive exponential growth peaking in </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>November/December</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> of every year.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> Optimize inventory management by stocking up heavily on top sub-categories (Phones, Chairs) by September to avoid Q4 stockouts. Scale back supply chains in Q1 to minimize overhead during slow months.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='18' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='97298' id='17' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98662' x='669' y='1351'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97298' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98662' x='669' y='1351'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20' underline='true'>INSIGHTS</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>1. High-Level Performance &amp; Efficiency</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>While Superstore, USA generated a massive </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>₹2.30M in Total Sales</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>, it operates on a lean </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>12.47% Profit Margin</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Conduct a deep-dive cost analysis into supply chain logistics or vendor pricing to optimize the margin closer.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>2. Technology Drives Revenue, Furniture Strains Margins</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Technology</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> is the highest-grossing category (</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>₹836,154</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>), led by </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Phones</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Chairs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> in sub-categories. Conversely, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Office Supplies</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> lag in sales volume</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> Shift marketing spend to promote high-margin Technology accessories. Bundle low-performing Office Supplies (like Fasteners and Envelopes) to increase their average order value.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>3. Consumer Segment Dominance</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> The </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Consumer Segment</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> represents over half of your business at </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>50.56%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>, followed by Corporate (30.74%) and Home Office (18.70%).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Launch a loyalty program specifically targeted at the Consumer segment to increase repeat purchases. Simultaneously, create a B2B sales outreach strategy to expand the higher-volume Corporate segment.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>4. The Return Rate Risk</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> The overall </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Return Rate stands at 5.91%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>A return rate near 6% for a retail superstore is a significant leak in net profit, introducing heavy reverse-logistics costs.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> Cross-reference this return rate with the &quot;Sales by States&quot; map. Identify if specific states  or specific product sub-categories have disproportionately high return rates due to shipping damages or poor product descriptions.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='15'>5.Cyclical Q4 Sales Spikes</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Insight:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Month Wise Sales</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> line chart reveals a distinct, repeating seasonal pattern: sharp dips early in the year followed by explosive exponential growth peaking in </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>November/December</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> of every year.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Actionable Recommendation:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans,Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='12'> Optimize inventory management by stocking up heavily on top sub-categories (Phones, Chairs) by September to avoid Q4 stockouts. Scale back supply chains in Q1 to minimize overhead during slow months.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{62BABA5D-6976-40BD-8D03-CD45B06E1630}' />
    </dashboard>
